From c6fb3737626ed364323d400ac8ac369318de6fd0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 15:57:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Documentation of the headers for the generic-parallel
 interfaces

Comments updated after the support of the generic-parallel libraries:
memory space instead of backend, allocation rules of the material data
managers, automatic switch of the functions acting on a material data
manager, refusal of the functions of a point, statuses of the material
properties, execution policies (no default queue for sycl, stack size,
synchronous computations), memory resources. Copies of the TFEL
structures aligned with their originals. Preexisting errors fixed in the
touched headers (update, parameters, typos).
---
